      "text": "Nephi1 beholds thunderings in promised land, 1 Ne. 12:4. the Lord has spoken to Laman1 and Lemuel with voice of thunder, 1 Ne. 17:45. the Lord will visit Israel with thunderings of his power, 1 Ne. 19:11 (2 Ne. 26:6). Gentiles to be visited with thunder, 2 Ne. 27:2. angel speaks to Alma2 and companions with voice of thunder, Mosiah 27:11 (Alma 36:7; 38:7). still voice of perfect mildness was not voice of thunder, Hel. 5:30. thunderings at death of Christ, Hel. 14:21, 26–27 (3 Ne. 8:6).",
